## KeywordsApi

### Get country&#39;s keyword metrics
## Get country&#39;s keyword metrics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/keywords/metrics?countryCode={{countryCode}}&keywords={{keywords}}
Accept: application/json

### Create keywords
## Create keywords
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/keywords
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "keywords": "<string>",
 "parent_id": "<string>"
}


### Get keywords
## Get keywords
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/keywords?campaignId={{campaignId}}&adGroupId={{adGroupId}}&adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}&matchTypes={{matchTypes}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update keywords
## Update keywords
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/keywords
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "keywords": "<string>"
}


### List trending keywords
## List trending keywords
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/trends/keywords/{{region}}/top/{{trend_type}}?interests={{interests}}&genders={{genders}}&ages={{ages}}&includeKeywords={{includeKeywords}}&normalizeAgainstGroup={{normalizeAgainstGroup}}&limit={{limit}}&includeDemographics={{includeDemographics}}
Accept: application/json
